# Lipsia Digital Homepage — Environment Variables
#
# This is a fully static build with no backend and no secrets.
# Only variables prefixed with VITE_ are exposed to the client bundle.
#
# ⚠️  WARNING: Anything prefixed VITE_ is PUBLIC and will be embedded
# in the final bundle. NEVER use VITE_ for secrets, API keys, or
# credentials of any kind.

# Example public variables (commented):
# VITE_SITE_URL=https://lipsia.digital
# VITE_CONTACT_EMAIL=info@lipsia.digital
